    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "pandas.Index.hasnans# Index.hasnans[source]# Return True if there are any NaNs. Enables various performance speedups. Returns: bool Examples >>> s = pd.Series([1, 2, 3], index=['a', 'b', None]) >>> s a 1 b 2 None 3 dtype: int64 >>> s.index.hasnans True",
